ped / 31 passed, 12 skipped; test_kernel_config_triton_sm7x.py 8 passed / 8 passed; test_mhc_prenorm_tensor_cores.py 0 passed, 7 skipped / 0 passed, 7 skipped; test_mhc_sm70_post_schedule.py 0 passed, 43 skipped / 43 passed; test_mhc_sm70_prenorm_staging.py 0 passed, 42 skipped / 42 passed; test_deepseek_v4_sm70_routes.py 30 passed / 30 passed; test_deepseek_v4_sm70_sparse_policy.py 3 passed / 3 passed; test_block_fp8_qpn8_capabilities.py 24 passed / 24 passed; test_sm70_modelopt_mixed_nvfp4.py 64 passed, 6 skipped / 70 passed; test_turing_qpn_kernel_selection.py 34 passed / 34 passed; test_flash_v100_dense_prefill_availability.py 2 passed / 2 passed; test_gpu_model_runner_v2.py 2 failed, 5 passed / 2 failed, 5 passed; test_prefill_overlap.py 16 passed / 16 passed. The failures are the same on main 4d57473db built from source: in test_gpu_model_runner_v2.py test_sm70_v2_mtp_profile_reports_from_last_pp_stage[pp2-last-stage-tp1] and [pp2-first-stage] on both cards, and test_sm70_qpn8_block_fp8.py::test_volta_medium_prefill_keeps_original_turbomind_output[64] on the V100. On this head, the two files of #1279's test commit: @@FIX_1282@@

